                "Congratulations. Come by anytime. We'll still feed you.",
            ],
        ),
        "Beehive": LeaderDef(
            name: "Biscuit",
            title: "Chief Volunteer",
            bio: "A golden retriever in a crisp white short-sleeved shirt, a tie and a volunteer name tag. Biscuit is always early, extremely polite, and never shows up anywhere without a casserole.",
            pick: [
                "Hi! I'm Biscuit. Oh my heck, thank you for picking Utah!",
                "Biscuit, Chief Volunteer. We'll be early, we'll be polite, and we'll be ready.",
            ],
            dawn: [
                "Good morning! I've been up since five. Scones are on the counter.",
                "Reminder: we don't start fights. We just finish them. Politely.",
                "Forecast: the Greatest Snow on Earth up high, red rock down low. Lovely day for it.",
                "Who needs help today? Our fighters can guard anybody's stuff.",
                "Industry, everyone! It's on the flag for a reason.",
            ],
            winning: [
                "We're ahead! Oh my heck! Thank you, everyone!",
                "Look at us go. Busy bees, busy bees.",
                "We're winning. Let's be gracious about it. Then win more.",
